{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46247","headline":"寄匡山大愿和尚 · 贯休","name":"寄匡山大愿和尚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一听玄音下竹亭，却思窗雪与囊萤。\n祗将清净酬恩德，敢信文章有性灵。\n梦历山牀闻鹤语，吟思海月上沙汀。\n不堪回首沧江上，万仞庐峯在杳冥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}